			Topic: Shikraak----Ferret Dragoons &nbsp;(Read 1069 times)
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=523" title="View the profile of Riffen">Riffen</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 4<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								An Everquest Player on Rodcet Nife<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=523"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=914.msg9067#msg9067"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=914.msg9067#msg9067">Shikraak----Ferret Dragoons</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> July 07, 2004, 02:44:24 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Hi all,<br /><br />&nbsp; Normally I take a lot of things with a grain of salt and just brush them off, but this one takes the cake in my book.<br /><br />&nbsp; Tonight myself playing a BL alt and a new EQ friend playing his/her alt Fhabio were grinding in Gunthak at the entrance to the fort. Things were going really well for a while untill this Monk from Ferret Dragoons (Shikraak) starts training mobs at us every couple of minutes. We asked him very nicely in tells and in say to stop training us. I would assume that the reason he was training was becuase he continously kept trying to take on more than what he could handle and coming to us expecting to get heals. In most cases I or my wife do not mind helping other people if we have the time. (My wifes 65 cleric Adriannaa was with us at the time keeping tabs on us and doing some pulling), but this was getting excessive. At some point Fhabio talked to an officer or some one in his guild and the Shikraak sent and apology which I will post from the log.<br /><br />[Tue Jul 06 22:04:41 2004] Shikraak -&gt; Zenjr: im sorry about b4 i dont expect you to forgive me infact i dont care i just want you to know im sorry didnt mean to get you....and thats all there is too it..<br /><br /><br />&nbsp; At this point in time I was not going to add him to the BL and stated so in the channel...<br />[Tue Jul 06 22:05:37 2004] You tell plzen:2, &#039;omg that monk sent an apology<br />[Tue Jul 06 22:06:07 2004] Fhabio tells plzen:2, &#039;i was speaking to some of his guildmates looking for the GL..&nbsp; talked to an officer about him<br />[Tue Jul 06 22:06:36 2004] You tell plzen:2, &#039;Cant add him to BL board since he apologzed that is highly frowned on the boards.<br />[Tue Jul 06 22:07:44 2004] Fhabio tells plzen:2, &#039;if they apoligize for an accident i&#039;d agree..&nbsp; this wasn&#039;t..<br /><br />&nbsp; After this had gone by and he went on about how he was dieing...<br /><br />[Tue Jul 06 22:06:36 2004] Shikraak -&gt; Zenjr: to be honest i just found out im dieing and im only 19 so yeah im kinda edgy when people are mean to me like adriannaa<br />[Tue Jul 06 22:06:48 2004] Shikraak -&gt; Zenjr: i dont even know why im telling you this later<br /><br />I tried to explain that Adrianna was there trying to watch 2 people and pets while grinding and was not going to have the time to sit there and heal him every time he came in with a train...<br /><br />[Tue Jul 06 22:07:25 2004] Zenjr -&gt; Shikraak: Adriannaa is my RL wife, she is sitting here trying to worry about healing 2 people and pets<br />[Tue Jul 06 22:07:51 2004] Shikraak -&gt; Zenjr: okay well i dunderstand that but im a real person and this is a game<br />[Tue Jul 06 22:08:24 2004] Shikraak -&gt; Zenjr: look i dont expect anything from you i just wanted to say i was sorry<br />[Tue Jul 06 22:08:24 2004] Zenjr -&gt; Shikraak: and in this game you need to treat people with the same respect you want. RL or not there are RL people behind the characters<br />[Tue Jul 06 22:08:51 2004] Shikraak -&gt; Zenjr: yes but i was trying to explain why i was acting that way did you not catch what i was saying?<br />[Tue Jul 06 22:09:13 2004] Shikraak -&gt; Zenjr: and your wife wasnt being very kind at all..<br /><br />&nbsp; By his last comment in the above cut and paste from the log I would assume that Shikraak meant by not healing him every time he came to us.<br /><br />&nbsp; The thing that pushed me over the top to make note of it here is coming now....<br /><br />[Tue Jul 06 22:10:22 2004] Shikraak -&gt; Zenjr: but ya shes your wife so i doesnt matter what i say im just gunna leave you with this &quot;there is a reason for everything, and nothing is what it seems&quot;<br />[Tue Jul 06 22:11:13 2004] Zenjr -&gt; Shikraak: what really got me whs when you said to give you a sow and you would leave yet you dumped a massive train on us AFTER I gave you what you asked for. That was tasteless.<br />[Tue Jul 06 22:11:59 2004] Shikraak -&gt; Zenjr: IM DIEING ASSHOLE<br /><br />&nbsp; At this point I reported and filed a petition on him and yet it continued.<br /><br />[Tue Jul 06 22:12:38 2004] Shikraak -&gt; Zenjr: americans your all the same why dont you go shoot some black people racists<br />[Tue Jul 06 22:13:34 2004] Shikraak -&gt; Zenjr: dieing im 19 your heartless arent you<br />[Tue Jul 06 22:13:41 2004] Shikraak -&gt; Zenjr: DIEING<br />[Tue Jul 06 22:14:02 2004] Shikraak -&gt; Zenjr: cancer ...i have all the money in the world but i cant pay to live..only to destroy<br /><br />&nbsp; At this point he went on ignore and thus shall stay there.<br /><br /><br />&nbsp; Personally I dont buy the &quot;I&#039;m dieing&quot; part of it, nor do I appreciate the trains even after he apologized. I know Fhabio can vouch for the incident. If anyone has more questions please feel free to ask.<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg9070"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=317" title="View the profile of Vanden RN">Vanden RN</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 194<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I'm a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=317"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=914.msg9070#msg9070"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=914.msg9070#msg9070">Re: Shikraak----Ferret Dragoons</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1 on:</b> July 07, 2004, 04:58:19 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I <i><b>told</b></i> him not to eat the fish.&nbsp; Now look what happened.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg9072"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=3" title="View the profile of EQSysquella">EQSysquella</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								GO GO NERFED DPS<br />
