								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=914.msg9072#msg9072"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=914.msg9072#msg9072">Re: Shikraak----Ferret Dragoons</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2 on:</b> July 07, 2004, 05:41:53 am &#187;</span></td>
