							I agree Grem, but which is more sad:<br /><br />*19, dying, spending your time in a game acting like an ass because you are running out of RL time instead of actually doing something with your remaining RL time with friends and family.<br /><br />*19 and claim you are dying in an attempt to cover up the fact you are just being an ass.<br /><br />One is sad, one is pathetic.<br /><br /><br />I did not hear the excuse in /t by Shikraak that he was dying.  He just stated to me that &quot;this is a game and i don&#039;t care how people think of me, my friends are in RL.&quot;<br /><br />Anyway...  Just posting to confirm these actions as it was my alt - Fhabio- that was involved and mentioned above by Riffen.
