							I know this is driving me nuts but&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wtf1.gif" alt="WTF" border="0" /> is a Ferret Dragoons?&nbsp; <br /><br />&nbsp; How was Adrieanna (or however you spell it) being mean?&nbsp; That is real sad to play on peoples feelings like that if he is dying.&nbsp; He probably has carpal tunnel and feels like dying.......&nbsp; Boy needs a break <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /> or he will end up like me&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/badhairday.gif" alt="badhairday" border="0" /> and&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/devil1.gif" alt="Devil" border="0" />
