								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							An in game friend of mine&#039;s little brother thought it would be funny to send me an IM one day saying &quot;Don&#039;t know how to tell you this but he was killed in a car accident this morning&quot;. Friend IMd me an hour later after CUdget and I were frantically searching for news articels to see if we could find out what had happened. Was so NOT cool&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wtf1.gif" alt="WTF" border="0" /><br /><br />Anyone who finds any kind of humour in that kind of statement is pathetic and sick. 
						</td>
					</tr>
