							Had a run in with him &lt;Shikraak&gt; in Crushbone while assisting some youngins in holding the TR. A truly unpleasant individual... basically he was KSing every mob the group got. His response to my asking him to not KS them &quot;When you pay for my account you can tell me how to play the game.&quot; Went to guild officers, they requested screenshots, but gave me bogus email to send em to. Have written him and his entire guild off.  <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/devil1.gif" alt="Devil" border="0" /><br /><br />&lt;Edit&gt; <br />Oh yeah he gave me the &quot;I don&#039;t care what people think of me in game...&quot; line also when i suggested he was doing wrong by his guild with such actions
